<title>USA: USDA offers Slovenia $35 mln under GSM-102.</title>
<headline>USDA offers Slovenia $35 mln under GSM-102.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Friday authorized $35 million in credit guarantees for sales of U.S. farm goods to Slovenia under the Export Credit Guarantee Program (GSM-102) for fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>USDA said the commodities covered are feed grains, wheat, rice, protein meal, oilseeds, cotton, cotton yarn and fabrics, hides, breeder livestock, wool and solid wood products.</p>
